First release. Needs AnkiDroid 2.24 or newer.
- Claude reads and edits your AnkiDroid collection: 34 tools for decks, notes, cards, tags and note types.
- Remote tab: connect through your AnkiMCP account; Claude wakes the phone when needed.
- Local tab: a free server on your Wi-Fi for Claude Desktop or Claude Code, no account needed.
- Plus and Pro plans through Google Play, when available.
- Battery tips for phones that freeze background apps.
- Share a detailed log for bug reports.
